{"fiche_id": "KB0040002", "client": "clientb", "title": "Imprimante en bourrage papier", "source": "KB0040002.md", "text": "## Symptôme\nL'imprimante signale un bourrage papier et refuse d'imprimer.\n\n## Résolution\n1. Ouvrez le capot de l'imprimante et retirez le papier coincé.\n2. Redémarrez l'imprimante.\n", "text_sha256": "1a8cc0a242d77bd27e84437b5bc90645d0e9cd33f70b31584775276b6c9d0a25", "status": "citable", "confidence": "low", "reasons": ["single method: the LLM pass did not run"], "sections": [{"title": "Symptôme", "role": "symptom", "start": 12, "end": 75}, {"title": "Résolution", "role": "resolution", "start": 89, "end": 181}], "steps": [{"n": 1, "start": 92, "end": 152, "text": "Ouvrez le capot de l'imprimante et retirez le papier coincé.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 2, "start": 156, "end": 180, "text": "Redémarrez l'imprimante.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}], "entities": [], "references": [], "methods": {"rules_steps": 2, "llm": null, "agreement": null}, "checks": {"steps_verified": 2, "steps_total": 2, "resolution_steps": 2, "failure_links": 0, "llm_quotes_rejected": 0, "instructions_dropped": 0}, "boilerplate_removed": 0, "masked": {}, "version": 1}
